			      C ;****************************************************************************
			      C 
			      C ;	GDI Definitions for Device Drivers
			      C ;
			      C ;	Since most of the routines only need a portion of these definitions,
			      C ;	conditional assembly flags have been defined in the various files
			      C ;	to only include portions as needed (as opposed to having a lot of
			      C ;	include files to mess with).  The flags are as follows:
			      C ;
			      C ;	incFont 	include font definitions
			      C ;	incDevice	include device definitions
			      C ;	incLogical	include logical object definitions
			      C ;	incDrawmode	include DrawMode structure definition
			      C ;	incOutput	include Output definitions
			      C ;	incControl	include Control definitions
			      C ;       incPolyScanline include Scan definition
			      C 
